<title>USA: BankAmerica cuts 80 jobs in brokerage unit.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica cuts 80 jobs in brokerage unit.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAmerica Corp said BA Investment Services, the broker dealer unit of BankAmerica Corp, has eliminated 80 employee positions.</p>
<p>It said these employees would be eligible for the bank's employee transition program. The employees affected were primarily administration and back office support staff, representing 10 percent of the unit's staff.</p>
<p>It said the action was taken due to improvements in technology, which requires fewer support staff.</p>
<p>Staff member eligible for the transition program can apply for other positions in the bank for which they are qualified.</p>
</text>
